{"id": "EUVD-2026-103075", "enisaUuid": "21c9bcb0-0a2e-3fe4-a9da-cc475097c210", "description": "53AIHub through 0.5.3 contains a missing authentication vulnerability that allows unauthenticated attackers to overwrite any enterprise's profile by sending PUT requests to /api/enterprises/:id. Because UpdateEnterprise only enforces checks when IS_SAAS is true, attackers can enumerate sequential enterprise IDs and overwrite logos, display names and branding for defacement and phishing.", "datePublished": "2026-10-16T17:39:20", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-16T17:39:20", "baseScore": 6.9, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@hieuPenguinnn/53aihub-unauth-cross-tenant-enterprise-update", "https://github.com/53AI/53AIHub/blob/v0.5.3/api/router/api.go#L54-L66", "https://github.com/53AI/53AIHub/blob/v0.5.3/api/controller/enterprise.go#L122-L160", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/53aihub-through-0.5.3-missing-authentication-via-put-api-enterprises-id"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-111653", "GHSA-8wfx-4q5w-fv72"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.35, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "983eb1ed-9c4a-357e-87d8-b55b5157ebfc", "product": {"name": "53AIHub", "vendor": {"name": "53AI"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22640.5.3"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "fe2b8557-3833-3f15-8ade-37035d0a0c00", "vendor": {"name": "53AI"}}], "isExploited": false}